            <ArticleTitle>The back of the problem.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>8-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The spinal column, and in particular the intervertebral discs that separate the vertebral bodies, provide a focal point for degenerative change and chronic pain. This article addresses the changing role of medical technology used in the therapeutic alternatives for this widespread condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
